  "description": "Farewell, Miss Original Female Lead. Three cycles of despair and death. At the end of each, I realized the woman who stole my husband and everything else was actually a possessor. The fourth return—now is the time to reclaim everything stolen. To do so, I needed a powerful ally. To a madwoman, a madman. \n\n*“Plunder me.”*\n\nCrown Prince Arpad Eastrid. I requested a marriage of plunder from him. \n\n *“In return, I'll keep Your Highness from going mad.”*\n\nAn offer he absolutely couldn't refuse. I stared straight at him, wearing a triumphant smile.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
